<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo adds further 500 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo adds further 500 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 2.0 billion marks from 1.5 billion marks, joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT   *2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.5 PCT   MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  17 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     *ORIGINAL DEAL LAUNCHED ON 30.APR.97.</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
